      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for movers and packers hyderabad to jabalpur</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When you hire <strong>movers and packers in hyderabad-relocation services in hyderabad</strong>, the first thing you need to know is that every interstate move must comply with statutory transit paperwork.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This includes a valid GST e‑Way bill for the goods, an IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty) that records the cargo details, and a comprehensive 100 % declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance covering accidental collision or unforeseen delays.</span></li></ul>

<p>The GST e‑Way bill is generated electronically before the vehicle departs from Hyderabad. It serves as proof of tax compliance and ensures that the goods can cross state borders without any legal hiccups.</p>
<p>The LR/Bilty, issued by the IBA, lists the type of items, weight, and destination, and it must be signed by the transporter and the shipper. These documents protect both parties against disputes and claim liabilities during transit.</p>

<p>Next comes the IRDAI marine transit insurance. Even though the goods travel by road, the insurance is structured like marine coverage because it protects against all risks that can arise during long‑haul movements.</p>
<p>It covers accidental collisions, theft, damage from weather or handling, and even delays caused by traffic or natural events. With 100 % declared value, you’re guaranteed full compensation for the actual worth of your belongings, giving you peace of mind.</p>

<p>Choosing the right team matters. Look for <strong>reliable packers and movers hyderabad</strong> who are licensed, have a clean safety record, and use the latest packing materials.</p>
